# n8n Cloud Agent

This repo is the home for the n8n cloud agent. Use `n8n-agent/` to change live workflows on Azure n8n.

## Instance

- Base URL: `https://n8n-rapid-czbff9cnafhkhmhf.eastus-01.azurewebsites.net`
- Auth header: `X-N8N-API-KEY`
- Credentials come from `N8N_BASE_URL` + `N8N_API_KEY` (environment secrets or `n8n-agent/.env`)
- Never commit, log, or paste the API key

## Commands

```bash
node n8n-agent/src/cli.js health
node n8n-agent/src/cli.js workflows list --search "<name>"
node n8n-agent/src/cli.js workflows export <id> --out n8n-workflows/<name>.json
node n8n-agent/src/cli.js workflows update <id> --file n8n-workflows/<name>.json
```

Programmatic import: `import { createClient, loadConfig } from './n8n-agent/src/index.js'`

## Safety

- Export before update. The GET payload has read-only fields; the client sanitizes them for PUT/PATCH.
- Do not activate, deactivate, archive, or delete a production workflow unless the user explicitly asked.
- Prefer inactive copies for experiments.
- Confirm the workflow id by name search before writing.
